<title>USA: Mark VII names Dunavant financial chief.</title>
<headline>Mark VII names Dunavant financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mark VII Inc said Philip Dunavant has been named vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Dunavant will replace J. Michael Head, who will continue in his role of executive vice president of Mark VII, and president of the risk management division.</p>
<p>Dunavant has served in various financial and management capacities since he joined the company as controller in 1989.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
